    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Ashes O</strong> :<strong>\u00a0Fast RPG</strong>\u23f3<strong>\u2600\ufe0f</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in a ruin, a strange yellow entity approaches you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Hurry up, the world ends in 5 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots are busy recycling the debris around you. It\u2019s unlikely you\u2019ll survive their aggression.<br>Luckily, the entity seems willing to let you relive the final 5 minutes of this world \u2014 to find answers, and maybe even a way to stop the programmed apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war is raging between the two major factions inhabiting this mysterious open world.<br>Why are they fighting? For resources, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique progression mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fight skyrockets your level \u2014 you can gain over 100 levels by killing a single monster.<br>Assign your stat points <strong>in real time</strong>, mid-combat, using the directional pad. Instantly adapt and fine-tune your character on the fly!<br><br>Gain skills and keep your items between each run to unlock new areas.<br>Items scale with percentage-based stat boosts, allowing you to become more powerful as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world that unfolds with each mobility upgrade and power boost, helping you overcome ever-tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Meet the factions H and V, locked in a brutal war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept their quests... or take down their NPCs to steal credits, XP, and loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support H against V... or the other way around?<br>Does it really matter? The world resets in 5 minutes anyway<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast and demanding RPG</strong> \u2013 Every action matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cryptic universe</strong> \u2013 Discover its final moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every loot counts</strong> \u2013 No junk gear. Every item has strategic value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique minimalist art style.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic combat system</strong> \u2013 Power and strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f <strong>You have 5 minutes. Good luck.</strong> \u2600\ufe0f<br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regular updates \u2013 Latest update: May 2025</strong><i>:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-</i><strong>Steam Cloud Save</strong> \u2013 Your progress is now backed up in the cloud.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>More enemies</strong> \u2013 Increased variety and new challenges.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>Enhanced environment graphics</strong> \u2013 Visual upgrades for a more immersive experience.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>New character attributes</strong> \u2013 Including <strong>Move Speed</strong> and other hidden mechanics to discover.<br>-<strong>Insane new movement abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock advanced ways to navigate and outmaneuver enemies.<br>-<strong>Character skin evolves with progression</strong> \u2013 Your appearance changes as you grow stronger.<br>-<strong>Improved Steam Deck compatibility</strong> \u2013 Smoother gameplay and better performance.<br><br><i>(Add the game to your wishlist to stay updated on future content!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Ashes O</strong> :<strong>\u00a0Fast RPG</strong>\u23f3<strong>\u2600\ufe0f</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in a ruin, a strange yellow entity approaches you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Hurry up, the world ends in 5 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots are busy recycling the debris around you. It\u2019s unlikely you\u2019ll survive their aggression.<br>Luckily, the entity seems willing to let you relive the final 5 minutes of this world \u2014 to find answers, and maybe even a way to stop the programmed apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war is raging between the two major factions inhabiting this mysterious open world.<br>Why are they fighting? For resources, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/b4d18a89be04fa6b75d4847b298f3089.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique progression mechanics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fight skyrockets your level \u2014 you can gain over 100 levels by killing a single monster.<br>Assign your stat points <strong>in real time</strong>, mid-combat, using the directional pad. Instantly adapt and fine-tune your character on the fly!<br><br>Gain skills and keep your items between each run to unlock new areas.<br>Items scale with percentage-based stat boosts, allowing you to become more powerful as you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world that unfolds with each mobility upgrade and power boost, helping you overcome ever-tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/a4020441aaa54f93281fe1fe266cf6d4.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Meet the factions H and V, locked in a brutal war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept their quests... or take down their NPCs to steal credits, XP, and loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support H against V... or the other way around?<br>Does it really matter? The world resets in 5 minutes anyway<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.poster.avif?t=1753880471\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.webm?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644020/extras/90ed7d5632c93ce81022760802e1620e.mp4?t=1753880471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast and demanding RPG</strong> \u2013 Every action matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cryptic universe</strong> \u2013 Discover its final moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every loot counts</strong> \u2013 No junk gear. Every item has strategic value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique minimalist art style.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic combat system</strong> \u2013 Power and strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f <strong>You have 5 minutes. Good luck.</strong> \u2600\ufe0f<br></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regular updates \u2013 Latest update: May 2025</strong><i>:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-</i><strong>Steam Cloud Save</strong> \u2013 Your progress is now backed up in the cloud.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>More enemies</strong> \u2013 Increased variety and new challenges.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>Enhanced environment graphics</strong> \u2013 Visual upgrades for a more immersive experience.<i></i><br><br><i>-</i><strong>New character attributes</strong> \u2013 Including <strong>Move Speed</strong> and other hidden mechanics to discover.<br>-<strong>Insane new movement abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock advanced ways to navigate and outmaneuver enemies.<br>-<strong>Character skin evolves with progression</strong> \u2013 Your appearance changes as you grow stronger.<br>-<strong>Improved Steam Deck compatibility</strong> \u2013 Smoother gameplay and better performance.<br><br><i>(Add the game to your wishlist to stay updated on future content!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
